{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51859","headline":"黄金台 · 无名氏","name":"黄金台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"燕昭北筑黄金台，四方豪杰乘风来。\n秦家烧书杀儒客，肘腋之间千里隔。\n去年八月幽州道，昭君墓前哭秋草。\n今年五月咸阳关，秦家城外悲河山。\n河上关头车马路，残日青烟五陵树。\n（见元人王恽《秋涧集》。\n《古今图书集成·职方典》二九《顺天府部》亦载此诗，题作《燕台》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51859.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51859","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}